{"slug":"592968-naa-iruvudee-heege","title":"ನಾ ಇರುವುದೇ ಹೀಗೆ!","titleEn":"Naa Iruvudee Heege","level":"3","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":592968,"authors":["Bindu Gupta"],"illustrators":["Kanak Shashi"],"translators":["Dr Akshata Shanbhag"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2023","originalStory":{"title":"मैं ऐसी ही हूँ!"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Naa Iruvudee Heege!’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ನಾ ಇರುವುದೇ ಹೀಗೆ! (Kannada), translated by Dr Akshata Shanbhag, based on original story मैं ऐसी ही हूँ!, written by Bindu Gupta, illustrated by Kanak Shashi, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2023) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"clouds","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":3,"title":"A sheep standing alone while others descend a mountain","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":4,"title":"A sheep gets stuck at the gate of a sheep-pen","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":5,"title":"A sheep watches another do yoga","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":6,"title":"A sheep practises yoga","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":7,"title":"A sheep tries to do yoga","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":8,"title":"A sheep stands among leaves","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":9,"title":"A sheep chewing leaves looks at another","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":10,"title":"An out-of-breath sheep looks at two others running","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":11,"title":"A sheep watches another swim","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":12,"title":"A sheep dives into water","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":13,"title":"A sheep floats on water","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":14,"title":"A sheep on a cycle speaks to another","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":15,"title":"A sheep images itself walking in the night","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":16,"title":"A sheep looks at a village from a height","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":17,"title":"Carpentry tools","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":18,"title":"A fence","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":19,"title":"Sheep look at a flock of sheep sleeping","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":20,"title":"Sheep relaxing inside an enclosure","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":21,"title":"A sheep looking up amid leaves","illustrator":"Kanak Shashi","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಎಂದಿನಂತೆ ಕುರಿಗಳ ಹಿಂಡು ಖುಷಿ-ಖುಷಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಮನೆಗೆ ಮರಳುತ್ತಿತ್ತು.","ಇವತ್ತೂ ಹೊರಗೆ ಮಲಗಬೇಕೆಂದು ಮಟ್ಕು ಮಾತ್ರ ಬೇಸರದಲ್ಲಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮಟ್ಕು ವಾರದಿಂದ ಹೊರಗೆ ಮಲಗುತ್ತಿದೆ.","ಇವತ್ತೂ ಕೂಡ ಮತ್ತೆ ಹೊರಗೆ ಮಲಗಬೇಕು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ದೊಡ್ಡಿಯ ಬಾಗಿಲು ಸಣ್ಣ ಕಿಂಡಿಯಂತಿದೆ!","ಮಟ್ಕು ಅದರೊಳಗೆ ಹೋಗಲು ಸಾಧ್ಯವಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಯೋಗಿ ಕುರಿ ಸಲಹೆ, “ಯೋಗ ಮಾಡು!","ಯೋಗದಿಂದ ನೀ ತೆಳ್ಳಗಾಗುವೆ. ಆಗ ನೀನು","ದೊಡ್ಡಿಯ ಬಾಗಿಲ ಮೂಲಕ ಒಳಗೆ ಹೋಗುವೆ.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p05.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಮರುದಿನದಿಂದ ಮಟ್ಕೂ ಯೋಗ ಮಾಡಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿತು."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹಲವು ದಿನಗಳು ಕಳೆದವು..."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["...ಏನೂ ಪ್ರಯೋಜನವಾಗಲಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p08.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಜಾಗರ್ ಕುರಿ ಸಲಹೆ, “ಜಾಗಿಂಗ್ ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸು! ಜಾಗಿಂಗ್​​​ನಿಂದ ನೀ ತೆಳ್ಳಗಾಗುವೆ. ಆಗ ನೀನು ದೊಡ್ಡಿಯ ಬಾಗಿಲ ಮೂಲಕ ಒಳಗೆ ಹೋಗುವೆ.”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p09.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಮರುದಿನದಿಂದ ಮಟ್ಕೂ ಜಾಗಿಂಗ್ ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿತು.","ಹಲವು ದಿನಗಳು ಕಳೆದವು... ಏನೂ ಪ್ರಯೋಜನವಾಗಲಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಈಜು ಕುರಿ ಸಲಹೆ, “ಈಜಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸು!","ಈಜುವುದರಿಂದ ನೀ ತೆಳ್ಳಗಾಗುವೆ. ಆಗ ನೀನು","ದೊಡ್ಡಿಯ ಬಾಗಿಲ ಮೂಲಕ ಒಳಗೆ ಹೋಗುವೆ.”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p11.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಮರುದಿನದಿಂದ ಮಟ್ಕು ಈಜಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿತು..."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p12.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಹಲವು ದಿನಗಳು ಕಳೆದವು... ಏನೂ ಪ್ರಯೋಜನವಾಗಲಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p13.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಬನ್ನಿ ಸೈಕಲ್ ಮೇಲೆ ಬಂದಿತು ಬಿಂಕದಿಂದ.","ಸೈಕ್ಲಿಂಗ್ ಕುರಿ ಸಲಹೆ, “ಸೈಕ್ಲಿಂಗ್ ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸು! ಸೈಕ್ಲಿಂಗ್​​​ನಿಂದ ನೀ ತೆಳ್ಳಗಾಗುವೆ. ಆಗ ನೀನು ದೊಡ್ಡಿಯ ಬಾಗಿಲ ಮೂಲಕ ಒಳಗೆ ಹೋಗುವೆ.”"]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p14.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಮಟ್ಕು ಹೇಳಿತು, “ಸಣ್ಣ ಆಗಲು ನಾ ಇನ್ ಯಾವ ಪ್ರಯತ್ನವನ್ನೂ ಮಾಡಲ್ಲ!”"]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p15.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಸಮಯದ ನಂತರ ಮಟ್ಕು ಚೀಲದೊಂದಿಗೆ ಬಂದಿತು.","ಚೀಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಕೆಲವು ಉಪಕರಣಗಳು ಇದ್ದವು."]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["...ಉಪಕರಣಗಳು!"]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p17.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮರುದಿನ ಬೆಳಗ್ಗೆ ಮಟ್ಕು ದೊಡ್ಡಿಯ ಒಳಗೆ ಸುಖವಾಗಿ ಮಲಗಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p18.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಉಳಿದ ಕುರಿಗಳೆಲ್ಲ ಬೆರಗಿನಿಂದ ಕೇಳಿದವು:","“ಹೇ, ಹೇಗ್ ಬಂದೆ ಒಳಗೆ? ತೆಳ್ಳಗಾದೆಯ?”","“ಯೋಗ ಮಾಡಿ ಸಣ್ಣ ಆಗಿದ್ದಾ? ಜಾಗಿಂಗ್ ಮಾಡಿನಾ?”"]},{"n":19,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p19.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಮಟ್ಕು ಹೇಳಿತು, “ಇಲ್ಲ ಕಣ್ರೋ ನಾ ತೆಳ್ಳಗಾಗಿಲ್ಲ. ಬಾಗಿಲು ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ದೊಡ್ಡದಾಗಿದೆ ಅಷ್ಟೇ.”","“ನಾ ಇರುವುದೇ ಹೀಗೆ!”"]},{"n":20,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/592968-naa-iruvudee-heege/p20.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":177}